(5, NULL, 'Cable Setup & Support', NULL, '<p>Expert cable setup and reliable support to keep your entertainment running smoothly.</p>', '<h3 data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"574\"><strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"572\">A. Installation &amp; Setup</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"665\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"606\">Set-Top Box Installation:</strong> Professional setup of cable boxes for HD and 4K viewing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<p data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"748\"><strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"692\">Wiring &amp; Connection:</strong> Proper cable wiring for clean and safe installations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"833\"><strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"785\">Channel Line-Up Configuration:</strong> Setup of all available channels and packages.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"923\"><strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"857\">Multi-Room Setup:</strong> Connect multiple TVs across your home with a single connection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><h3 data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"963\"><strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"961\">B. Troubleshooting &amp; Support</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<li data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1036\"><strong data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"984\">Signal Issues:</strong> Fix poor signal quality or channel interruptions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1108\"><strong data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1064\">Set-Top Box Problems:</strong> Repair or replace malfunctioning devices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1191\"><strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1133\">Parental Controls:</strong> Assistance in setting up restrictions for safe viewing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1262\"><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1215\">Software Updates:</strong> Keep devices updated for smooth performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><h3 data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1293\"><strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1291\">C. Service Upgrades</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1366\"><strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1317\">Channel Packages:</strong> Add or remove channels as per your preference.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1444\"><strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1390\">Premium Channels:</strong> Setup HBO, Sports, and other premium subscriptions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1470\">On-Demand Services:</strong> Assistance with on-demand video and streaming services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><h3 data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1580\"><strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1578\">D. Why Choose Our Cable Setup &amp; Support?</strong></h3><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><ul data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1872\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1653\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1609\">Certified Technicians:</strong> Skilled professionals for reliable setup.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1710\"><strong data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1673\">Fast Service:</strong> Same-day installation and support.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1786\"><strong data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1736\">Affordable Pricing:</strong> Clear and