(6, NULL, 'Bill Payment Services', NULL, '<p>Fast and secure bill payment services for all your utilities.</p>', '<h3 data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"580\"><strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"578\">A. Types of Bills You Can Pay</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<li data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"642\"><strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"605\">Electricity Bills:</strong> Pay all major power utility bills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"699\"><strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"659\">Gas Bills:</strong> Easy gas bill payment without queues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"756\"><strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"718\">Water Bills:</strong> Hassle-free water bill settlements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"833\"><strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"788\">Telecom &amp; Internet Bills:</strong> Pay mobile, landline, and broadband bills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"906\"><strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"865\">Cable &amp; TV Subscriptions:</strong> Quick payment for all cable operators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><h3 data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"944\">B. Payment Options Available</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<li data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1052\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"969\">Online Payments:</strong> Secure transactions via credit/debit cards, bank transfers, and digital wallets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1137\"><strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1074\">Auto-Pay Setup:</strong> Automatically pay recurring bills without missing deadlines.</p>\r\n</li>\r