(7, NULL, 'Bundle Packages', NULL, '<p>Affordable bundle packages combining TV, Internet, Phone, and more.</p>', '<h3 data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"565\"><strong data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"563\">A. Available Bundle Options</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"639\"><strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"586\">TV + Internet:</strong> Perfect for entertainment and high-speed browsing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"723\"><strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"663\">Internet + Phone:</strong> Stay connected online and through calls at reduced rates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"809\"><strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"766\">Triple Play (TV + Internet + Phone):</strong> All-in-one solution for maximum savings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"876\"><strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"831\">Custom Bundles:</strong> Create your own package as per your needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><h3 data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"914\"><strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"912\">B. Features of Our Bundles</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"997\"><strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"940\">Discounted Pricing:</strong> Get up to 30% savings compared to individual services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1069\"><strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1028\">Single Bill Convenience:</strong> Pay for all services in one easy bill.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1143\"><strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1094\">Free Installation:</strong> Bundle customers enjoy zero installation fees.<